1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
一个小县城，开出8万家店
One county — 88,000 shops nationwide

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
比多数洋快餐还多
More than most fast-food giants

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
它叫沙县小吃
It's called Shaxian snacks

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
四大金刚：拌面、扁肉
Four staples: noodles, wontons

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
蒸饺、炖罐，一份几块钱
dumplings, clay-pot — a few yuan each

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
便宜、管饱、开在街角
cheap, filling, on every corner

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
靠的不是大资本
Not built on big capital

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
是几十万夫妻店
but hundreds of thousands of mom-and-pop shops

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
集团认证加盟不到5%
Under 5% are official franchises

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
一代沙县人，背井离乡
A whole generation left home to cook

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
一碗拌面，喂饱半个中国
One bowl of noodles fed half of China

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
福建人一句：好呷
As Fujian folks say: hó-tsia̍h — tasty

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
下集：一座城，靠烧烤爆红
Next: a city that blew up on BBQ
